    "physical_description": "Head cloth of cotton batik. Waxed with the tjanting and dyed indigo and brown on a cream ground. The field is patterned with a parang motif, and in each corned is repeated a wing (lar) motif incorporating a broad tail. The centre of the field is broken by a lozenge (modang) bordered with a frieze of small stylised leaves (tjekmukirran).",
